  "name": "30th CELEBRATION Promo Card Pack",
  "category": "campaign",
  "description": {
    "text": "A pack of promos with the 30th anniversary stamp from the Pokémon Card Game's 30th anniversary in Japan: Alolan Exeggutor, Moltres, Articuno, Greninja ex, Zapdos, Sylveon ex and Lucario (148 to 154/M-P). One pack was the participation prize of Pokémon Card Gym battles from 16 September 2026 to 31 January 2027, and packs were also given at the 30th CELEBRATION EVENT in Chiba on 25 October 2026 and in Osaka on 31 October and 1 November 2026. The same pictures came on the English 30th Celebration promos MEP 094 to MEP 100.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: M-P Promotional cards (TCG), card list",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/M-P_Promotional_cards_(TCG)#Card_list"
      }
    ]
  },
